    all: [['A student', 'A presentation by Friday, an essay plan, a CV that gets replies.'], ['A freelancer or specialist', 'A portfolio site, offers to clients, a content plan, invoices.'], ['A parent or a retiree', 'Documents, letters, trip plans, a family budget — explained simply.'], ['A creator', 'Ideas, scripts, a posting calendar, a channel that grows.'], ['A small business', 'A site, replies to customers, ads and reports — everything in one app.'], ['A team or a company', 'Roles, requests, AI assistants for each person, your own CRM connected.']],
    onlyH: 'What only Vaxo does',
