    plansNote: 'Everything in a plan is included, the website too. You pay extra only for something fully custom — the price is fixed before work starts. A paid plan starts with a free trial month (a part of the monthly tasks, one trial per person or company).',
    growH: 'It grows when people tell each other',
    grow: [['Clients invite friends', 'Your friend gets a gift month after paying; you get +1 month of your plan. A gift is a discount on our service, never cash.', 'Your invite link', '/me/'], ['Partners earn money', '50% of the first payment and 30% of every next one for as long as the client pays. 18+, payouts after the client pays.', 'Become a partner', '/partners/'], ['Gifts and tools', 'Free calculators, a shop of ready templates and AI kits.', 'See free tools', '/tools/']],
    trustH: 'What we promise — and what we do not',
